    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
      children: ["Bulk operations that act on multiple resources simultaneously present parameter design challenges. Should you use path variables, query strings, or request bodies for identifying the target resources? The answer depends on the operation type and data volume. For retrieving multiple resources by ID, you have several options: query string arrays (", _jsx(_components.code, {
